      "file_type": "rationale",
      "norm_label": "cagr return calculation",
      "rationale": "CAGR is computed from the latest NAV back to the NAV closest to 1/3/5 years ago, rounded to 1 decimal; if history doesn't extend far enough for the 3- or 5-year point the field is omitted rather than guessed. This reflects the agent's core principle of never inventing numbers not derived from actual fetched data.",
